# Boolean fit gates (scripts/gate.sh): "<part> empty" must render zero
# facets, "<part> interferes" is the mandatory negative control.
#
# fitcheck      — the frame's cage (deck footprint excluded: the movers never
#                 reach its z band) intersected with everything that moves
#                 across the FULL stroke AND the arch's full snap (band
#                 mirrored through the chord). Must be empty.
# fitcheck_neg  — the same sweep grown 0.5 mm past its clearances; must
#                 interfere, proving the empty check can fail.
fitcheck      empty
fitcheck_neg  interferes
